      "chapter": "Answering"
    },
    {
      "id": "task",
      "narration": "Ask for a small feature, and tell the leader to check with you first.",
      "leadIn": 0.3,
      "tail": 0.4,
      "minSeconds": 24.3,
      "steps": [
        {
          "action": "press",
          "key": "ArrowDown"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": "question",
      "narration": "The leader asks, with its choices as options. A digit answers with one of them; slash would let you write your own.",
      "leadIn": 0.3,
      "tail": 0.4,
      "minSeconds": 17.4,
      "steps": [
        {
          "action": "press",
          "key": "ArrowDown"
        }
      ],
      "chapter": "A question"
    },
    {
      "id": "ask",
      "narration": "A worker builds it, and its change waits for you, before anything ran.",
      "leadIn": 0.3,
      "tail": 0.4,
      "minSeconds": 20.5,
      "steps": [
        {
          "action": "press",
          "key": "ArrowDown"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": "notes",
      "narration": "Read the change. C puts a note on the line at hand; enter keeps it. N sends every note back to the worker, each under its file and line.",
      "leadIn": 0.3,
      "tail": 0.4,
      "minSeconds": 24.8,
      "steps": [
        {
          "action": "press",
          "key": "ArrowDown"
        }
      ],
      "chapter": "Notes on a change"
    },
    {
      "id": "permission",
      "narration": "Now the worker wants to run a command that is not a test, so it asks you. A allows this command from now on, for the whole project; e would allow everything until its turn ends. If the item changed under you, imece asks you to read it first, and you press again.",
      "leadIn": 0.3,
      "tail": 0.4,
      "minSeconds": 28.0,
      "steps": [
        {
          "action": "press",
          "key": "ArrowDown"
        }
      ],
      "chapter": "A permission"
    },
    {
      "id": "output",
      "narration": "The worker ran the command on a scratch file, and proposed its change again.",
      "leadIn": 0.3,
      "tail": 0.4,
      "minSeconds": 14.9,
